Your mucus is brought to near sentience.

Each turn, there is a [29%, 33%, 35%, 37%, 38% (TL1-5; CUN 100; MP 100)] chance that a random spot of your mucus will spawn a Mucus Ooze.

Mucus Oozes last [6, 7, 8, 9, 10 (TL1-5)] turns and will attack any of your foes by spitting slime at them.

You may have up to [1, 1, 3, 4, 5 (CUN 10-100; MP 10-100)] Mucus Oozes active at any time (based on your Cunning).

Any time you deal a mental critical, the remaining time on all of your Mucus Oozes will increase by 2.

The spawn chance increases with your Mindpower.
